{
  "_comment": [
    "Skill synergies: 5 or more ranks in one skill give a +2 bonus on another, from",
    "the SRD's Table: Skill Synergies (and the Expanded Psionics Handbook's psionic",
    "skills). Every synergy bonus is untyped, so several on one skill stack.",
    "",
    "  from      the skill with the ranks - a subject skill names its subject:",
    "            \"Knowledge (arcana)\"; \"Craft\" alone means any one Craft",
    "  to        the skill that gains the bonus, or null when the bonus is on",
    "            something that is not a skill line (bardic knowledge, turning)",
    "  condition when the bonus applies only in some checks: shown beside the",
    "            skill, never added to its total",
    "  note      for a bonus on something other than a skill"
  ],
